  "scope": "Whole FS compile of compiler and CLI corpora with a walk-local function statement index for evidence slot stamping. Parallel lowering is not measured or changed.",
  "implementation": {
    "index": "Map from definition-table name to all matching statement positions in table order. Read the live AST from last to first until a plain SLet/EFn is found.",
    "lifetime": "Constructed inside edp_stamp_slot_rows, passed explicitly through the stamping walk; no global lookup cache.",
    "compatibility": "Preserves last-valid duplicate precedence, table-name keys, live parameter updates, unknown callee behavior, labeled parameter selection and existing scope guards. Other callers keep the original linear edp_params_of_fn.",
    "tradeoff": "One O(definitions) index per stamp walk; persistent tables are not retained between programs."
  },
